(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/):

  - the recording of "I'm So Happy To Be Here" (audio/happy.mp3, and any other
    audio of the song),
  - its lyrics (song/lyrics.txt, song/lyrics.original.txt, and the lyric
    text in data/lyrics.approx.json and on screen),
  - the analysis data derived from the recording (data/, song/analysis.md),
